{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12111150","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1211114001:":{"text":"호드킨! 설마 그 녀석이 우리보다 먼저 보물을 찾은 건가?","source_cn":"霍德希金！难道他比我们先找到宝藏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0584325D2361C1ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1211114002:":{"text":"그럴 리가... 호드킨이 어째서 여기 있는 거지?","source_cn":"不可能……他怎么会来到这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634EB0A57AA61D54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1211114003:":{"text":"흥... 놀랐나?","source_cn":"哼……感到惊喜吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4709126B8AA0405B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211115001:0":{"text":"저세상 끝까지 도망간다고 해도 나약한 벌레가 내 손바닥을 벗어날 수는 없지!","source_cn":"就算跑到天涯海角，弱小的虫子终究无法逃出我的手心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B954E5AC78DADA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211115002:0":{"text":"우리를 몰래 뒤따라 오다니!","source_cn":"你竟然跟踪我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC993AC0FE279F083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211115003:0":{"text":"대체 언제부터 뒤따라온 거지? 어째서 아무도 알아채지 못한 거야!","source_cn":"他究竟是从什么时候开始跟踪的？为什么没有任何一个人察觉到！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9862270142E71C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211115004:0":{"text":"소니아 언니! 저 사람은 누구야? 어디서 튀어나온 사람이야?","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐！这是谁？他是从哪里冒出来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE71D4BDCEEA08E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211115005:0":{"text":"걱정 마, 널 다시 빼앗아 가게 두지 않을 테니까!","source_cn":"别怕，我不会让他又一次把你抢走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4D95ABCC74045AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211115006:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 경계를 늦추지 마! 저 녀석은 죽음의 함대의 지도자이자, <style=\"highlight\">불사호의 선장... 호드킨</style>이야!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x34248A0F43C124B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 경계를 늦추지 마! 저 녀석은 죽음의 함대의 지도자이자, <style=\"highlight\">불사호의 선장... 호드킨</style>이야!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 경계를 늦추지 마! 저 녀석은 죽음의 함대의 지도자이자, <style=\"highlight\">불사호의 선장... 호드킨</style>이야!","variant_male_record_index":"131624","variant_female_record_index":"131625","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211115007:0":{"text":"이 나쁜 놈! 이게 전부 저놈이 계획한 거란 말이야...? 진작에 여기 매복해 있다가 우리가 계략에 빠지기만을 기다리고 있었던 거야!","source_cn":"这个混账！一切都是他计划好的吗……他早就埋伏在这里了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x764E1BE824FD19D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211115008:0":{"text":"호드킨, 우릴 막을 생각 마!","source_cn":"霍德希金，你别想阻拦我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71894212AD5B8F83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211115009:0":{"text":"막다니? 농담도 참...","source_cn":"阻拦？开玩笑——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985D70CCA543AC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211115010:0":{"text":"내 손짓 한 번이면 사라질 벌레 주제에!","source_cn":"区区虫子，我挥挥手就能让你们灰飞烟灭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3BFF8AC2D226D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:12011126:0":{"text":"마침내 동굴의 끝까지 도착했지만, 그곳에는 환영이 우리를 기다리고 있었다. 신밧드와 소니아는 그 환영이 호드킨이라는 것을 알아챘다.","source_cn":"你们终于来到了洞穴的终点，一道幻影却早已在此等待。辛巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37274ABEE2BD38F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_